				(justify right)
			)
		)
	)
	(text "External comms port, VE.Direct pinout (plans/ext-comms-port.md)\n\nJ5 pin | signal | dir (Fugu view) | notes\n1 | GND | - | logic GND = Bat-; non-isolated\n2 | RX | in | 3.3 V logic, 5.5 V tolerant (U8), idles high (R50)\n3 | TX | out | 3.3 V push-pull via 220R, Hi-Z unless EXT_TX_OE_N low (R46 pull-up)\n4 | V+ | out | +3.3V via Schottky D22, always on; ~2.85 V at 170 mA (VF ~0.35 V typ)\n\nMCU: EXT_TX GPIO36, EXT_RX GPIO37, EXT_TX_OE_N GPIO48\n(not GPIO38/39: driven low in USB-OTG download boot mode, Espressif schematic checklist)\nWrong-adapter protection is in software only (Fab, 2026-09-28/29): no V+ switch, no V+ current sense.\nNo short protection on pin 4 (Fab, 2026-09-29): a short browns out the shared 0.5 A LM5163 rail.\nA PTC cannot help: any PTC holding 0.17 A at 60 C trips at 0.75 A, above the rail's 0.5 A.\nD22 blocks a peer that drives pin 4.\nAdapters draw far more than a Victron port's 10 mA; label them 'Fugu only'."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "edd903e2-21c5-e3a8-1c95-157c5e6650cf")
	)
	(text "External comms port (VE.Direct pinout)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
